{"name": "Deadliest Pigeon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deadliest Pigeon</strong> is a <strong>physics based</strong> <strong>action shooter</strong> where you play as a <strong>vengeful pigeon!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Packed</strong> with <strong>various actions</strong>, offering <strong>short</strong> yet <strong>intense gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>His rage is unleashed!</strong>\u00a0There\u2019s no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687790/extras/e424bd9f8b2c5a03f705c4b35b32f06f.poster.avif?t=1786036623\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687790/extras/e424bd9f8b2c5a03f705c4b35b32f06f.webm?t=1786036623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687790/extras/e424bd9f8b2c5a03f705c4b35b32f06f.mp4?t=1786036623\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Forget</strong> the <strong>breadcrumbs</strong>. <strong>Albert the Pigeon </strong>wants <strong>blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687790/extras/5531ce97f15dbb05e521981df3d86473.poster.avif?